Strategic Remediation and Competitive Overhaul Roadmap
To systematically depose the competitor domain and reclaim the premier ranking position on global search engines for the "LIC Jeevan Umang Calculator" entity, the subject domain must execute a comprehensive, multi-phased overhaul of the page architecture. This strategy relies on instantly updating the core actuarial entity, maximizing the existing E-E-A-T and editorial superiority, and implementing advanced, structured technical SEO.

Phase 1: Entity Updating and Algorithmic Realignment
The absolute, immediate priority is to sever all semantic and programmatic ties to the obsolete Plan 945 and permanently realign the digital asset with the active Plan 745.

Metadata Overhaul: The digital marketing team must update the HTML <title> tag from its current state, which explicitly targets the defunct plan, to clearly highlight the current iteration. A recommended, highly optimized structure is: LIC Jeevan Umang Calculator (Plan 745) | Premium & 8% Survival Income.

Semantic Content Scrubbing: Editors must scour the article, removing all active references to Plan 945. However, maintaining a brief, highly targeted historical note explaining that Plan 745 has officially superseded both Plan 945 and Plan 845 is highly strategic. This nuanced approach captures search traffic from users who may inadvertently search for older plan versions out of habit, while seamlessly redirecting their commercial intent to the active, purchasable product.   

Actuarial Engine Recalibration: The JavaScript architecture powering the calculator must be rigorously audited and updated to reflect the exact actuarial tables, age limits, sum assured increments, and high-sum-assured rebates of Plan 745. Furthermore, the engine must visually decouple the Base Premium from the GST logic (4.5 percent in year one, dropping to 2.25 percent in subsequent years), displaying both data points clearly in the final output dashboard, as this degree of financial transparency is highly rewarded by both users and algorithmic behavioral tracking.   

Phase 2: Technical SEO and Structured Data Injection
To outmaneuver the competitor on a technical level, the subject domain must deploy flawless, nested schema markup to explicitly define the page's utility to search crawlers.

Implement SoftwareApplication Schema: Developers must wrap the calculator component in validated JSON-LD schema to explicitly define it as a financial tool, providing search engines with undeniable, machine-readable proof of the page's interactive value.   

Implement FAQPage Schema: The existing fifteen-question FAQ section represents a massive, currently unexploited digital asset. Converting these prose questions and answers into structured data will immediately enable rich results eligibility, pushing competitors further down the SERP and monopolizing visual space.   

Strengthen Entity Connections: Developers must tie the page entity tightly to the author entity using schema properties. By programmatically linking the content to the credentialed Certified Financial Planner author, the domain will maximize its inherent E-E-A-T signals in a manner the competitor cannot easily replicate.   

Phase 3: Content Enhancement and Interface Optimization
While the competitor relies heavily on raw dynamic tables, the subject domain can secure long-term dominance by combining a superior, mathematically perfect calculator with its already excellent, narrative-driven editorial content.

Recalibrate Case Studies: The editorial team must recalculate the "Young Professional," "Pre-Retiree," and "Child’s Future" examples using precise Plan 745 metrics. These narratives must explicitly state they are based on the latest iteration of the plan, reinforcing the page's temporal accuracy.   

Enhance the Output Interface: The UI/UX team must upgrade the calculator's visual output to exceed the competitor’s granularity. When a user executes a calculation, the UI should display a clean, highly visual dashboard showing the Base Premium, the distinct GST loads, the total capital outlay over the PPT, and an exact chronological timeline projecting the eight percent survival benefit payouts cascading up to age one hundred.   

Detailed Rider Explanations: While the subject domain currently includes optional rider toggles within the tool interface, it must expand the supporting text to explain the exact mechanics of these additions. For example, detailing how the LIC Accidental Death and Disability Benefit Rider provides monthly financial installments spread over ten years, while simultaneously waiving all future base policy premiums in the event of permanent disability, provides critical consumer context that aids in conversion.   

By executing this rigorous, data-driven remediation roadmap, the subject domain will correct its primary algorithmic failing regarding product obsolescence. By combining its inherent editorial and authoritative advantages with flawless technical infrastructure, the subject domain is highly capable of overriding the competitor's exact-match domain advantage, capturing the highest tier of user engagement signals, and ultimately reclaiming and holding the premier position in organic search results for all LIC Jeevan Umang calculation queries.


